      "content": "I'll read the original test and CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — removing unused imports, grouping related assertions with comments, and adding descriptive messages.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes the 10+ unused imports, adds a Javadoc comment explaining the method's contract, and attaches a descriptive message to each assertion so the intent of every boundary case (null, zero, sub-millisecond values, exact millisecond boundary, and 1 ms + 1 ns) is immediately clear to readers."
